('e486c385-0870-4d3f-ab24-c891995f9af6','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Marrakech Adventure Club SARL','Marrakech Adventure Club','activity',2,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','ar'],'A local outdoor club offering hiking, cycling, and climbing for all levels. Certified guides, quality equipment, and a passion for sharing Morocco''s natural beauty.',5.4,98.1,98,3.8,'active'),
('cbe83bfa-ef42-465b-bf3e-d81930f8eac0','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Atlas Extreme Sports SARL','Atlas Extreme Sports','activity',3,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','de'],'Adrenaline specialists — quad biking, sandboarding, paragliding, and canyoning. Professional instructors, top safety record, and GoPro footage included.',7.3,88.4,246,4.6,'active'),
('a2bdef82-e9e3-48d8-80f7-53d0e0ea8f02','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Sahara Wellness Retreat SARL','Sahara Wellness Retreat','activity',3,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr'],'A wellness sanctuary offering hammam, massage, yoga, and meditation sessions. Organic argan oil treatments and sound healing in a tranquil garden setting.',8.3,98.5,443,3.7,'active'),
('834f4ece-1358-4d92-968b-71274f29d6aa','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Desert Nomad Tours SARL','Desert Nomad Tours','desert_experience',2,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','ary-Latn'],'A Berber family business running camel treks and overnight camps in the dunes since 2005. Basic but authentic — real nomad-style camps with woven tents and campfire music.',6.5,97,343,4.9,'active'),
('6fffd5ff-f556-420c-be81-47f56cdb2fa9','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Erg Luxury Expeditions SARL','Erg Luxury Expeditions','desert_experience',4,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','es','it'],'Premium desert experiences with luxury glamping tents (real beds, en-suite bathrooms), gourmet dinners, and 4x4 Land Cruisers. Stargazing with a telescope included.',7.4,90.8,153,4.1,'active'),
('f8de0ebe-9d35-4060-b6bf-45a4e136805c','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Dune Riders Marrakech SARL','Dune Riders Marrakech','desert_experience',2,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr'],'A young team of desert enthusiasts offering sandboarding, quad biking, and buggy tours. Half-day and full-day options. Includes picnic lunch and water.',3.6,91.7,59,4.2,'active'),
('6d3c485e-1e34-44e3-9587-cc3e95d7591d','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Marrakech Shuttle Express SARL','Marrakech Shuttle Express','transfer',1,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr'],'Affordable shared shuttle service between the airport, train stations, and city hotels. Fixed schedules, comfortable minibuses, and friendly drivers.',10.8,97.8,50,4.3,'active'),
('ef8cb5c6-d8e6-403a-84f3-de970a619c1a','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Atlas Private Transfers SARL','Atlas Private Transfers','transfer',3,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','ar'],'Private door-to-door transfers with professional drivers and modern sedan cars. Flight tracking, meet-and-greet at the airport, and 24/7 availability.',5.3,95.7,191,4.3,'active'),
('8011097d-c7fc-48b4-bb4b-54c9d2fe9ec7','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Royal Chauffeur Morocco SARL','Royal Chauffeur Morocco','transfer',4,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','es'],'Luxury chauffeur service with Mercedes E-Class and V-Class vehicles. Leather interiors, bottled water, phone chargers, and English-speaking drivers in suits.',2.5,93.2,270,3.7,'active'),
('b19ef38b-ea7c-4b1b-b63c-5f8e49bb68ba','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','ONCF — Office National des Chemins de Fer SARL','ONCF — Office National des Chemins de Fer','transfer',2,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','ar'],'Morocco''s national railway operator. High-speed Al Boraq trains connect Tangier to Casablanca via Rabat in under 3 hours. Conventional trains serve Casablanca, Rabat, Fès, Meknès, Marrakech, Tangier, and Oujda. Book at gare.oncf.ma or at any train station.',2,98,3931,4.1,'active'),
('d48d30d4-83af-4498-b85d-5825dfcaa306','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Marrakech Shuttle Express — Station Pickup SARL','Marrakech Shuttle Express — Station Pickup','transfer',1,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr'],'Affordable shared shuttle service between the airport, train stations, and city hotels. Fixed schedules, comfortable minibuses, and friendly drivers. We also offer ONCF station pickup and drop-off services.',1.5,94,133,4.8,'active'),
('80730efe-9065-4f81-b288-c12939ec0360','MA','a1111111-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Atlas Private Transfers — Station Pickup SARL','Atlas Private Transfers — Station Pickup','transfer',3,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','ar'],'Private door-to-door transfers with professional drivers and modern sedan cars. Flight tracking, meet-and-greet at the airport, and 24/7 availability. We also offer ONCF station pickup and drop-off services.',1.5,94,87,4.2,'active'),
('c57071a3-2c43-43b8-a2ec-82976b77ad13','MA','a3333333-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Fès Heritage Walks SARL','Fès Heritage Walks','tour',2,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','ary-Latn'],'A family-run walking tour company founded in 2009. We specialize in intimate small-group tours of historic quarters, led by licensed local guides who grew up in these streets.',3.7,88.4,52,4.3,'active'),
('ed967411-6ea5-416a-824b-b9fbc11dfa68','MA','a3333333-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Atlas Cultural Tours SARL','Atlas Cultural Tours','tour',3,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','de'],'Mid-size cultural tour operator with air-conditioned minibuses and university-trained historians. We cover major landmarks with comfortable logistics.',3.1,90.9,35,4.7,'active'),
('46909dba-1d97-4d19-bf1b-ff2167ecc847','MA','a3333333-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Royal Concierge Fès SARL','Royal Concierge Fès','tour',4,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','es','it'],'Private luxury touring service with Mercedes vans, art-historian guides, and exclusive access to private palaces and collections not open to the public.',3.4,88.6,450,3.9,'active'),
('87cda17c-2d5a-4849-923e-c767274b2000','MA','a3333333-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Local Eyes Fès SARL','Local Eyes Fès','guided_experience',1,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','ary-Latn'],'A collective of young local guides who show you the real city — hidden cafes, street art, and neighborhoods the guidebooks miss. Pay-what-you-want ethos.',9.7,89.6,413,4.5,'active'),
('61c43874-78aa-4a8e-a2bf-272772749907','MA','a3333333-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Insider Morocco SARL','Insider Morocco','guided_experience',3,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','ar'],'Boutique guiding company pairing you with a dedicated guide for a personalized half-day or full-day experience. We adapt the route to your interests on the fly.',10.2,93,345,3.9,'active'),
