('6e276340-cec8-44aa-98f3-84e3d7d2c40a','MA','a06060a0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Le Salon Ouzoud SARL','Le Salon Ouzoud','meal',4,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr'],'Fine dining in an elegant riad setting. Modern Moroccan cuisine by a chef trained in Paris and Marrakech. Wine pairing available. Reservation required.',4.8,88.4,369,4.1,'active'),
