('830b15c8-2ea5-4389-bf7b-1a5b18e8ce52','MA','a00c00c0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','Taroudant Heritage Walks SARL','Taroudant Heritage Walks','tour',2,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','ary-Latn'],'A family-run walking tour company founded in 2009. We specialize in intimate small-group tours of historic quarters, led by licensed local guides who grew up in these streets.',5.3,96.7,32,3.9,'active'),
