('10b412f4-3486-4ff0-aa02-c3ce94c2e1f5','MA','a00a00a0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','ONCF — Office National des Chemins de Fer SARL','ONCF — Office National des Chemins de Fer','transfer',2,'verified',ARRAY['en','fr','ar'],'Morocco''s national railway operator. High-speed Al Boraq trains connect Tangier to Casablanca via Rabat in under 3 hours. Conventional trains serve Casablanca, Rabat, Fès, Meknès, Marrakech, Tangier, and Oujda. Book at gare.oncf.ma or at any train station.',2,98,1947,4.1,'active'),
