('43ef0497-a518-4b70-b7f2-139a23c52d85','89b79cea-eefa-4950-a923-f36cd1fe377b','MA','a00a00a0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','transfer','Tetouan Multi-Stop Transfer Service','Immerse yourself in Moroccan culture with Tetouan Shuttle Express. Savor spices and flavors unique to this region.',ARRAY['en','fr'],5,1,jsonb_build_object('wheelchair',false,'mobility_aid',false,'stamina_required','low'),1,16,30,1,'published','https://images.pexels.com/photos/36870373/pexels-photo-36870373.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940'),
('49bbc747-525d-4820-8a42-4e0502b467c1','e3832467-fe79-4802-9f32-c34b86326792','MA','a00a00a0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','transfer','Tetouan Transfer to Tangier','Discover the authentic side of Tetouan with Atlas Private Transfers. Witness sunrise over breathtaking natural formations. Perfect for history buffs.',ARRAY['en','fr','ar'],5,2,jsonb_build_object('wheelchair',false,'mobility_aid',true,'stamina_required','low'),1,4,45,3,'published','https://images.pexels.com/photos/30532036/pexels-photo-30532036.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940'),
('fff021f2-3fab-437b-ad68-d1288482852f','e3832467-fe79-4802-9f32-c34b86326792','MA','a00a00a0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','transfer','Tetouan Transfer to Chefchaouen','Experience Tetouan like a local with Atlas Private Transfers. Traverse landscapes that have inspired poets for centuries.',ARRAY['en','fr','ar'],3,1,jsonb_build_object('wheelchair',false,'mobility_aid',true,'stamina_required','low'),1,4,45,3,'published','https://images.pexels.com/photos/15138864/pexels-photo-15138864.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940'),
('d535a779-51cd-40dd-b3a0-5166fd8db33b','5d506fb0-f00c-4e20-9345-39df22eef861','MA','a00a00a0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','transfer','Tetouan Luxury Chauffeur Service','Discover the authentic side of Tetouan with Royal Chauffeur Morocco. Marvel at intricate tilework and carved cedar ceilings. Perfect for history buffs.',ARRAY['en','fr','es'],4,2,jsonb_build_object('wheelchair',false,'mobility_aid',true,'stamina_required','low'),1,7,90,4,'published','https://images.pexels.com/photos/26976906/pexels-photo-26976906.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940'),
('2eb63ff0-2153-44e6-bf00-17c972eb8e05','5d506fb0-f00c-4e20-9345-39df22eef861','MA','a00a00a0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','transfer','Tetouan Multi-Stop Transfer Service','Discover the authentic side of Tetouan with Royal Chauffeur Morocco. Visit lesser-known landmarks and meet local artisans. Perfect for adventure seekers.',ARRAY['en','fr','es'],4,1,jsonb_build_object('wheelchair',false,'mobility_aid',true,'stamina_required','low'),1,7,120,4,'published','https://images.pexels.com/photos/9043496/pexels-photo-9043496.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940'),
('99be936e-01ac-4433-94b7-4abf8ab15822','5d506fb0-f00c-4e20-9345-39df22eef861','MA','a00a00a0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','transfer','Tetouan Group Shuttle Service','Experience Tetouan like a local with Royal Chauffeur Morocco. Explore ancient medina alleys most tourists never see.',ARRAY['en','fr','es'],5,1,jsonb_build_object('wheelchair',false,'mobility_aid',true,'stamina_required','low'),2,7,60,4,'published','https://images.pexels.com/photos/4906448/pexels-photo-4906448.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940'),
('1481d272-92de-40c7-ad97-8cd7e20f8758','10b412f4-3486-4ff0-aa02-c3ce94c2e1f5','MA','a00a00a0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','transfer','ONCF Train Service from Tetouan','Official ONCF rail service departing from Tetouan train station. High-speed Al Boraq available on the Tangier–Casablanca route. Conventional trains connect to major Moroccan cities. Book your ticket at the station or at gare.oncf.ma.',ARRAY['en','fr','ar'],0,1,jsonb_build_object('wheelchair',false,'mobility_aid',false,'stamina_required','low'),1,50,180,2,'published','https://images.pexels.com/photos/112395/pexels-photo-112395.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940'),
('f0e37c0a-773e-4e86-99da-cd1213617678','fe14bf3e-3080-4f4b-b3a7-eed8b76222c6','MA','a00a00a0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','transfer','Tetouan Train Station Pickup & Drop-off','Private shared shuttle service to and from the ONCF train station in Tetouan. Meet your driver at the station exit with a name sign. Flight and train tracking included.',ARRAY['en','fr'],0,1,jsonb_build_object('wheelchair',false,'mobility_aid',false,'stamina_required','low'),1,16,60,1,'published','https://images.pexels.com/photos/12898337/pexels-photo-12898337.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940'),
('0ed5a317-906e-46ae-b4bf-18804c19ab1e','df331447-a85d-4e90-b090-dff6afa510d5','MA','a00a00a0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa','transfer','Tetouan Train Station Pickup & Drop-off','Private chauffeur service to and from the ONCF train station in Tetouan. Meet your driver at the station exit with a name sign. Flight and train tracking included.',ARRAY['en','fr','ar'],0,1,jsonb_build_object('wheelchair',false,'mobility_aid',true,'stamina_required','low'),1,4,30,3,'published','https://images.pexels.com/photos/38427512/pexels-photo-38427512.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940')
